resource FakeRule
  id param:     id
  update:       full replace (PUT), no mask
  update id:    in the body (id), not in the path

operations
  create  POST    /fake/rules/v1       FakeRulesService_CreateFakeRule   body inline  response CreateFakeRuleResponse.rule
  get     GET     /fake/rules/v1/{id}  FakeRulesService_GetFakeRule      body -       response GetFakeRuleResponse.rule
  update  PUT     /fake/rules/v1       FakeRulesService_ReplaceFakeRule  body inline  response ReplaceFakeRuleResponse.rule
  delete  DELETE  /fake/rules/v1/{id}  FakeRulesService_DeleteFakeRule   body -       response DeleteFakeRuleResponse

fields
  NAME         BEHAVIOR   CREATE             UPDATE             GET  TYPE
  id           computed   -                  -                  yes  string
  name         normal     required           required           yes  string len 1..64
  kind         immutable  required           -                  yes  enum RuleKind [RULE_KIND_LOGS RULE_KIND_SPANS]
  description  normal     optional presence  optional presence  yes  string len ..256
  enabled      normal     optional presence  optional presence  yes  bool
  priority     normal     optional presence  optional presence  yes  integer int32 0..10
  tags         normal     optional presence  optional presence  yes  list<string>
  condition    normal     required           required           yes  object RuleCondition
      query      required           string len 1..
      threshold  optional presence  number double 0..
  createTime   computed   -                  -                  yes  string date-time
